# The generated snippet table and any PRIVATE packs. NEVER in git.
#
# Since 6.162.0 the public packs are committed under packs/ and this
# folder is where tools/build-snippets.lua WRITES (snippets/bundled.lua)
# plus any pack that must not be published — textpanders (real email
# addresses, phone numbers, an employee ID, out-of-office text) used to
# be here and now lives in LL's OneDrive snippets folder instead.
#
# 🚨 bundled.lua stays ignored too (6.105.0): it is whatever packs were
# on this machine folded into one file, private ones included, so
# committing it "because it is only build output" would put personal
# data in git by a side door. It is built at packaging time and travels
# in the zip.
snippets/
